@EquipmentApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5056

GET {{EquipmentApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
GET http://localhost:5056/api/Equipment
### 应该返回 2 条

GET http://localhost:5056/api/Equipment/1
### 应该返回 Line1-Press

POST http://localhost:5056/api/Equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Line3-Drill", "status": "Normal"}
### 应该返回 201，id 是 3

PUT http://localhost:5056/api/Equipment/3
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Line3-Drill", "status": "Fault"}
### 应该返回 200，status 变成 Fault

DELETE http://localhost:5056/api/Equipment/3
### 应该返回 204，没有响应体

GET http://localhost:5056/api/Equipment
### 应该又回到 2 条
